WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.131 --> 00:00:01.992
- Should I just walk in
or should I do the whole

00:00:01.992 --> 00:00:04.742
stopping every like five seconds?

00:00:06.317 --> 00:00:08.774
So right now, my boyfriend
is in the other room,

00:00:08.774 --> 00:00:09.858
and he thinks that we're here

00:00:09.858 --> 00:00:11.807
just to talk about our dream wedding.

00:00:11.807 --> 00:00:15.879
But, we're gonna surprise him
and put on a wedding dress.

00:00:15.879 --> 00:00:17.942
- I hope he has a really good reaction

00:00:17.942 --> 00:00:19.970
because it's something
that I've been waiting for

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.043
like 12 years.

00:00:21.043 --> 00:00:23.358
You know when you see
those videos it's like

00:00:23.358 --> 00:00:24.898
if I'm walking down the
aisle and my boyfriend

00:00:24.898 --> 00:00:26.963
doesn't cry or have that reaction

00:00:26.963 --> 00:00:29.515
I'm gonna go back and walk again.

00:00:29.515 --> 00:00:32.024
- Tam and I think about
getting married all the time.

00:00:32.024 --> 00:00:34.480
She may not know this,
but I think about it more

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:37.116
than she does simply
because she is so deserving.

00:00:37.116 --> 00:00:41.274
- I am 30, she is 29, so we see ourselves

00:00:41.274 --> 00:00:44.494
having kids in the next,
maybe, two and half years,

00:00:44.494 --> 00:00:45.327
three years.

00:00:45.327 --> 00:00:46.574
- My thing of a dream wedding is

00:00:46.574 --> 00:00:48.816
just simply inviting all
our friends, all our family.

00:00:48.816 --> 00:00:50.378
I want there to be a routine

00:00:50.378 --> 00:00:52.032
that me and a couple of friends

00:00:52.032 --> 00:00:54.504
and family practice
out on the dance floor,

00:00:54.504 --> 00:00:56.740
and we do a special dance for 'em.

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:57.801
That's the only thing that I want.

00:00:57.801 --> 00:00:59.760
- I would like to get married in a place

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:02.702
that resembles of a barn or a farm.

00:01:02.702 --> 00:01:06.869
Not extremely fancy, but it's
still really well decorated.

00:01:07.856 --> 00:01:09.464
- Okay I think this is the one.

00:01:09.464 --> 00:01:10.942
I hope it fits.

00:01:10.942 --> 00:01:13.240
I know women go back and forth and

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:14.906
trying dresses like a thousand times.

00:01:14.906 --> 00:01:16.267
- Oh, that actually looks really nice.

00:01:16.267 --> 00:01:17.100
- [Woman] Okay.

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:20.537
- You just have to stop eating
for, like, a good four days.

00:01:20.537 --> 00:01:23.027
Just to fit into a dress like
this for your wedding day.

00:01:23.027 --> 00:01:24.687
- I'm just so scared because

00:01:24.687 --> 00:01:26.269
I've never been in a wedding dress before.

00:01:26.269 --> 00:01:29.652
We've been to so many
weddings and stuff like that,

00:01:29.652 --> 00:01:32.875
and it's always me
watching the other woman

00:01:32.875 --> 00:01:34.768
getting married and
having the white dress on.

00:01:34.768 --> 00:01:38.181
- This is really random and
probably very weird of me,

00:01:38.181 --> 00:01:40.192
but I brought my grandma's pearls

00:01:40.192 --> 00:01:41.775
'cause I figured if I'm
gonna try on a wedding dress

00:01:41.775 --> 00:01:43.889
for the first time, I might
as well wear the accessories

00:01:43.889 --> 00:01:45.979
I plan on wearing on the actual day.

00:01:45.979 --> 00:01:47.887
- What makes me attracted to Callie

00:01:47.887 --> 00:01:50.983
is, besides her looks, which
is not the most important

00:01:50.983 --> 00:01:51.993
thing, is her character.

00:01:51.993 --> 00:01:54.350
Her laughter is very contagious.

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:57.761
She is very understanding,
extremely intelligent.

00:01:57.761 --> 00:01:59.500
She is a great whole person.

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:04.069
She is smart, as I said, and
knows how to dance very well,

00:02:04.069 --> 00:02:06.479
and I'm blessed to be
able to be her partner.

00:02:06.479 --> 00:02:09.794
- What I love about Tam is that
Tam is the complete opposite

00:02:09.794 --> 00:02:10.627
of me.

00:02:10.627 --> 00:02:13.679
Knowing myself in the past,
I am known to be very, very

00:02:13.679 --> 00:02:16.336
complacent, just satisfied with who I was

00:02:16.336 --> 00:02:18.561
and what I was doing in life.

00:02:18.561 --> 00:02:19.756
I wanted to swim with the stream.

00:02:19.756 --> 00:02:22.896
Thing about Tam is that she
swims against the stream.

00:02:22.896 --> 00:02:25.052
She wants to dream a little.

00:02:25.052 --> 00:02:27.412
She wants to go out and live.

00:02:27.412 --> 00:02:28.245
- Oh no.

00:02:31.304 --> 00:02:36.070
- When it comes to language
because you can always

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:38.582
talk to people based on ...

00:02:38.582 --> 00:02:39.415
What's going on?

00:02:39.415 --> 00:02:40.917
- [Callie] I don't know.

00:02:40.917 --> 00:02:41.821
- Oh my God.

00:02:41.821 --> 00:02:44.071
(laughing)

00:02:45.491 --> 00:02:46.724
You look gorgeous.

00:02:46.724 --> 00:02:47.557
- Awww.

00:02:47.557 --> 00:02:49.803
(laughing)

00:02:49.803 --> 00:02:50.698
How do you feel?

00:02:50.698 --> 00:02:51.531
- Happy.

00:02:51.531 --> 00:02:52.387
- Genuinely I'm nervous.

00:02:52.387 --> 00:02:53.220
(laughing)

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:54.053
- Did you expect this?

00:02:54.053 --> 00:02:56.026
- No, did you?

00:02:56.026 --> 00:02:56.859
- Maybe.

00:02:56.859 --> 00:03:00.278
- Since we're here, I was
wondering if you wanted

00:03:00.278 --> 00:03:01.956
to just get married today.

00:03:01.956 --> 00:03:03.479
(laughing)

00:03:03.479 --> 00:03:04.609
I told them that

00:03:04.609 --> 00:03:06.551
you were waiting for 12 years.

00:03:06.551 --> 00:03:07.889
- Yeah it don't matter.

00:03:07.889 --> 00:03:11.152
- I've been nervous all day long

00:03:11.152 --> 00:03:13.178
because I really didn't
know what to expect.

00:03:13.178 --> 00:03:14.495
- Are you sure?

00:03:14.495 --> 00:03:16.056
- Let's just do it babe.

00:03:16.056 --> 00:03:17.473
We came this far.

00:03:18.358 --> 00:03:19.526
We might as well, you know?

00:03:19.526 --> 00:03:21.107
It's been 12 years.

00:03:21.107 --> 00:03:21.940
- Are you guys ready?

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:22.773
- I'm ready.

00:03:22.773 --> 00:03:25.012
- Dearly beloved and honored guests,

00:03:25.012 --> 00:03:27.302
just the three of you behind the cameras.

00:03:27.302 --> 00:03:28.680
- You were asking me about

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:31.536
what would be my outfit
like for the wedding day.

00:03:31.536 --> 00:03:33.184
And I was saying that
it'd be something classic

00:03:33.184 --> 00:03:36.078
but is still stylish, I would
be wearing suspenders ...

00:03:36.078 --> 00:03:37.965
- I now pronounce you man and wife.

00:03:37.965 --> 00:03:39.053
You may kiss the bride.

00:03:39.053 --> 00:03:41.303
(laughing)

00:03:42.977 --> 00:03:43.810
- I love you.

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:44.650
- I love you, too.

00:03:44.650 --> 00:03:46.900
(clapping)

00:03:47.906 --> 00:03:49.411
- When I first seen her,

00:03:49.411 --> 00:03:51.089
I was like, oh she looks so beautiful.

00:03:51.089 --> 00:03:52.664
Oh, is she gonna sit down next to me?

00:03:52.664 --> 00:03:54.142
I think we're gonna stand up,

00:03:54.142 --> 00:03:55.933
and then I seen Steven
after and I was like,

00:03:55.933 --> 00:03:58.851
wait, oh so that's what
kind of party we gonna have.

00:03:58.851 --> 00:04:00.445
- The reaction that I thought
I was gonna get from him

00:04:00.445 --> 00:04:02.406
was what's going on.

00:04:02.406 --> 00:04:03.866
- I was like I'm not ready because

00:04:03.866 --> 00:04:06.512
I don't have the real things here.

00:04:06.512 --> 00:04:08.083
I'm not looking right.

00:04:08.083 --> 00:04:10.883
- Like, I couldn't have
asked for a better reaction.

00:04:10.883 --> 00:04:12.594
I mean, I didn't think that
you would cry honestly.

00:04:12.594 --> 00:04:14.308
He's not really easily to cry.

00:04:14.308 --> 00:04:17.726
- This is a person that I
really feel intrigued about,

00:04:17.726 --> 00:04:20.809
attracted to, in love with, and yeah.

00:04:22.711 --> 00:04:23.905
It's my sweaty girl right here.

00:04:23.905 --> 00:04:24.738
(laughing)

00:04:24.738 --> 00:04:27.162
- I feel liberated, like a
big weight has been lifted

00:04:27.162 --> 00:04:29.513
off my shoulders because
it's been a long time coming.

00:04:29.513 --> 00:04:31.539
Even if it was a prank,
I still feel the love,

00:04:31.539 --> 00:04:33.129
and I still feel like it was ...

00:04:33.129 --> 00:04:35.736
I really appreciate her
pranking the hell out of me.

00:04:35.736 --> 00:04:37.674
- With her by my side, it doesn't matter.

00:04:37.674 --> 00:04:39.398
Fears can come.

00:04:39.398 --> 00:04:40.894
We're gonna go through anything.

00:04:40.894 --> 00:04:42.830
- He's just the sweetest
person I've ever met,

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:44.303
so bring in the priest.

00:04:44.303 --> 00:04:45.570
(laughing)

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:48.153
(gentle music)

